==Other==
[[Karil's crossbow]], when worn with the rest of [[Karil the Tainted's equipment]] and an [[amulet of the damned]], grants a 25% chance for an attack to hit twice, in which case the second hit will inflict half the damage of the first.

Some weapons have [[Special_attacks#Multi-hit|special attacks that hit multiple times in one attack]]. The player must choose to activate these attacks.

